    "body": "## Summary\n- load bookmark state for the visible discovery page with the authenticated batch saved-job endpoint\n- avoid N+1 per-card status requests while preserving public discovery for signed-out users\n- let discovery cards toggle save/remove state and keep the page-level bookmark set synchronized after successful mutations\n- keep bookmark lookup failures non-fatal so public jobs remain visible\n- document the hydrated bookmark flow\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- the batch endpoint remains authenticated and returns only the current user's saved job ids\n- public job discovery remains unchanged and does not expose exact participant-only locations\n- save/remove operations continue to use the existing idempotent authenticated endpoints\n\n## Validation\nCI should run frontend lint/build, Maven tests, Flyway/PostgreSQL smokes and existing runtime gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
